    <updated>2026-04-27T00:00:00Z</updated>
    <category term="Architecture"/>
    <summary>We named the company after a phrase. Most privacy products sell hiding; we sell unreliability. What that buys, and the lines we will not cross to ship it.</summary>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title>Why we&apos;re building Thundercrab</title>
