  <entry>
    <title>Provable-by-construction privacy</title>
    <link href="https://plausiden.com/blog/provable-privacy" rel="alternate"/>
    <id>https://plausiden.com/blog/provable-privacy</id>
    <published>2026-04-27T00:00:00Z</published>
    <updated>2026-04-27T00:00:00Z</updated>
    <category term="Architecture"/>
    <summary>Two ways to promise to protect data: a policy you trust, or a property the type system enforces. We pick the second where the engineering allows.</summary>
  </entry>
  <entry>
